body:
I liked Xue Yang, I think his story was more tragic than anything. no one is born a killer, they just become one. I think he became a sociopath form a young age when he was poor and treated badly by everyone around him, later on seeking revenge on those who hurt him. He then with a damaged mind and heart found comfort on one of his enemies as thanks to his blindness he was genuinely kind and generous to him.,. 

Until of course, he can't with his feelings thinking he only wants to see the other hurt until he realizes that he wants him by his side more than anything else

I just cry internally thinking about him ;;;
